{"3877520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thief's Adventure", "steam_appid": 3877520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/705f18d7aff904eeb3fb93fe2337d3d7.avif?t=1782813645\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief's Adventure</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth game where careful planning is more important than quick reflexes. Control a team of thieves, combine their abilities, infiltrate heavily guarded locations, and complete your objectives without raising the alarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters with abilities that complement each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels that demand creativity, patience, and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of environments, including countryside villages, towns, gloomy prisons, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple story that unfolds across each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty levels and optional achievements for players who want to master every challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each member of the crew brings different skills.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hector</strong> silently eliminates, distracts, and hides the evidence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bowser</strong> picks locks and sets deadly traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amelia</strong> uses her bow, whistle, and can disguise herself to deceive enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch enemy patrols, learn their routines, and wait for the perfect moment to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.poster.avif?t=1782813645\" width=760 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.webm?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.mp4?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities for best results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.poster.avif?t=1782813645\" width=760 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.webm?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.mp4?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the way is clear, enjoy your hard earned loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/d9f75c6a4b6a181f014235e70c6beeb2.poster.avif?t=1782813645\" width=760 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shar