the evidence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bowser</strong> picks locks and sets deadly traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amelia</strong> uses her bow, whistle, and can disguise herself to deceive enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch enemy patrols, learn their routines, and wait for the perfect moment to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.poster.avif?t=1782813645\" width=760 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.webm?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/300017eaa6ac2eae7ac26a54f5857198.mp4?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities for best results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.poster.avif?t=1782813645\" width=760 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.webm?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/extras/a59202df9780bb0d931a4f488ae97cfd.mp4?t=1782813645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the way is clear, enjoy your hard earned loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">